Package: com.nano.liquidlock
Name: LiquidLock
Version: 1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Animated Face ID for notched iPhones. The lock turns into a Face ID face that waits for you while Face ID looks (and on the passcode screen), curls into a spinning ring with a check when you unlock, and shakes like jelly when it does not recognize you. Made by nano.
Maintainer: nano
Author: nano
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
